    "minimumForDiagnosis": "Prolonged QTc interval plus pathogenic SCN5A mutation or prolonged QTc with clinical history consistent with arrhythmia",
    "notes": "Diagnosis is supported by genetic testing and clinical presentation; absence of mutation does not exclude diagnosis."
